        "description": "<p class=\"feature\">The night hag has a soul bag. While holding or carrying the bag, the night hag can use its Nightmare Haunting action.</p><p class=\"feature\">The bag has AC 15, HP 20, and Resistance to all damage. The bag turns to dust if reduced to 0 Hit Points. If the bag is destroyed, any souls the bag is holding are released. The night hag can create a new bag after 7 days.</p>",
