    {
      "_id": "1qjq1bs1ggdi5a00",
      "_key": "!actors.items!mmNightHag000000.1qjq1bs1ggdi5a00",
      "name": "Phantasmal Killer",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "icons/magic/death/undead-ghosts-trio-blue.webp",
      "system": {
        "active": true,
        "description": "<p>You tap into the nightmares of a creature you can see within range and create an illusion of its deepest fears, visible only to that creature. The target makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 4d10 Psychic damage and has Disadvantage on ability checks and attack rolls for the duration. On a successful save, the target takes half as much damage, and the spell ends.</p><p>For the duration, the target makes a Wisdom saving throw saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a failed save, it takes the Psychic damage again. On a successful save, the spell ends.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong>The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 4.</p>",
